    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag and payment management</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">If the vehicle is being moved on toll roads, ensure the FASTag is active and linked to a prepaid account. Record the tag number in the loading manifest and share it with the driver or logistics partner, be it sri anjaneya packers and movers or a railway parcel office.</p>
